@host = http://127.0.0.1:5048
@taskId = REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID_FROM_A2ACLI

# Start --agent proactive and A2ACli with --return-immediately and
# --use-push-notifications as described in ../README.md.
# Copy the returned task ID above and leave the CLI running.

### Send the exact text as an agent message on the existing task.
# Repeat with different text; the task stays Working.
POST {{host}}/proactive/tasks/{{taskId}}/continue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "External job finished"
}

### Inspect persisted state and history without sending another message.
POST {{host}}/proactive
A2A-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "inspect-proactive-task",
  "method": "GetTask",
  "params": {
    "id": "{{taskId}}"
  }
}
